PLACEHOLDER: the production release signing public key goes here.

This file must hold the RSA-3072 public key (SubjectPublicKeyInfo PEM, the
"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----" block) whose private half is the RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY
secret of the release workflow. Until it does, the server refuses to serve it,
installers cannot install an updater, and the release workflow stops before it
tags. See docs/ops/distribution.md, "The release signing key".
